母の思いを聞き入れず、逃げ出そうとするが傷を負って逃げられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"処女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「だめっ！　だめええっ！！　出されちゃうっ！　孕まされてっ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孕まされてイッちゃうぅぅぅ！　ああっ！　いやぁあああああっ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18827","sourceWorkId":"10359","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"気の強い真面目タイプ。要するにツンデレ。一つのことに夢中になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"任務で忍び込んだ母の行方を追って屋敷にやってくる。すると甲斐甲斐しく主人公の世話をしつつも嬉しそうな母の姿を見て「何故!?」と混乱し「寝返ってしまったのか!?」とまで思い込んで、母と主人公を殺そうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしくのいちとしての実力はまだ十分ではなく、母との戦いで傷ついてしまったところを主人公に匿われる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸せになって欲しいと願う母の思いを聞き入れず、逃げ出そうとするが傷を負って逃げられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"処女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"221809"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94e559ee162df00d005a9959c4188b6d7edfaaaba56ec5100485dc9ebf9d3962.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30d7f73e4a01e52fbc8f463e1cee36d9cfa416b19edda324e64c2dcc4c797d09.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c114529","characterName":"宮代 裕樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c114529"},"originalCharacterName":"宮代 裕樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p2095","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:3291","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2095","name":"HighRunning","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:15448:3291","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2095","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2095","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2095","name":"HighRunning","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb: